Note on scope

This MIT licence covers the code in this repository (HTML, CSS, JavaScript).

The derived geophysical fields embedded in horizon3d.html — horizon depths, the
sigma field, leave-one-out residuals and pick coordinates — are derived from the
Schillerslage data set of Igel et al. (2019), Zenodo,
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2686824, and are redistributed under CC-BY-4.0,
inherited from the source. Attribution is required when these fields are reused.
See the "Data" and "License" sections of README.md.
